Thu Nov 12 20:25:02 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Initial package (2.14.2):
  * Support Stream Deck MK.2 with Scissor Keys Module
  * Keep custom action state images and text on plugin events
  * Harden plugin and device event handling: validate device ID
    length and plugin namespace ownership, reject duplicate
    WebSocket registrations
  * Packaging (opendeck-disable-telemetry.patch,
    opendeck-no-deno-build.patch, opendeck-npm-build-deps.patch):
    telemetry opt-in (off by default), in-app update check off,
    system Node.js build, native helpers compiled from source

